//! The `flood-opacity` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property defines the
//! opacity of the current filter primitive subregion in `feFlood` and `feDropShadow` elements within
//! a `filter`. If present, it overrides the element's `flood-opacity` attribute.
//!
//! Initial: black. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
